msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"That was too slow⑬much too slow! What could you have\r\n"
"possibly been doing to waste so much time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Here's some money, but only because I promised I'd pay you.\r\n"
"I won't be asking you for help again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You got <Color:8>2,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"You're still welcome to come by and eat with the rest of our\r\n"
"customers, though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Oh, you're back! I didn't expect to see you so soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "This is everything they paid me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Wonderful. Thank you for your help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"It looks like you were a little slow on some of the\r\n"
"deliveries... but you were still a big help. I appreciate\r\n"
"all the trouble you went through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"All right. Here's a little something for you.\r\n"
"It's not much, but you earned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "You got <Color:8>5,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Next time you visit, you can just relax and enjoy your meal.\r\n"
"I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Oh, you're back! I didn't expect to see you so soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "This is everything they paid me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Wonderful. Thank you for your help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"You really helped us out of a pinch, so I'd like to give\r\n"
"you a little something. Oh, and I threw some extra in\r\n"
"there to show my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"Next time you visit, you can just relax and enjoy your meal.\r\n"
"I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"You're not done with your deliveries yet! Come on, we're\r\n"
"counting on you here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "You idiot! How do you expect to deliver all those orders?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"I'm... so sorry... I had no idea we had so many of them\r\n"
"backed up like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Do you honestly think you can deliver these all by yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Ah. I apologize. I didn't mean for you to see us like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"It's just that this dumbbell here took on far too many\r\n"
"deliveries than he could handle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"And it's not like we have anyone else on hand to help,\r\n"
"either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Sorry I caused so much trouble..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"If only I had one more person to take on deliveries... that\r\n"
"would be so much help. Oh, but where could I possibly find\r\n"
"someone that would help out on such short notice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Yeah, that might be tough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"Well. Never mind about that. You're here for some of our\r\n"
"delicious soba noodles, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "(I don't need to eat right now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Thanks a lot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "All set? Then come back and see us again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"How about if I lend a hand? I'm sure you need all the help\r\n"
"you can get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"Would you!? That would be wonderful! We just don't have\r\n"
"enough delivery people here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "You'll have to visit three locations:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid ""
"The <Color:7>drugstore in Kariyushi Arcade<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"the <Color:7>mahjong parlor on East Hatsumachi<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"and the <Color:7>info center in Hatsumachi<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"The soba you'll be delivering is here in these boxes, so\r\n"
"could you take them around to all three of those locations?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"You've got <Color:7>5 minutes<Color:Default>. I don't want to keep our\r\n"
"customers waiting, so hop to it. I'll pay you a\r\n"
"part-timer's wages if you do a good job!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid ""
"The <Color:7>drugstore in Kariyushi Arcade<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"the <Color:7>mahjong parlor on East Hatsumachi<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"and the <Color:7>info center in Hatsumachi<Color:Default>, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"All right. I'll deliver these as quickly as humanly possible.\r\n"
"Be right back."
msgstr ""

